        data-word-rotate-interval-value="3000">Discord</span> alternative for communities.</h1>
      <p class="landing-hero-sub">Simple, intentional chat for communities, without a subscription. Rooms, threads, DMs, search. Open source, free to use, free to leave.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="landing-cta-row">
      <a href="<%= new_registration_path %>" class="landing-btn-primary">
